{"t":"2026-07-26T18:15:35.981Z","tool":"plan_create","args":{"objective":"Fix all bugs in the DOOM-like raycasting FPS game and serve it playable via preview port","steps":["Identify all code-level bugs by analyzing doom.html","Bug 1: en.dist undefined in shoot() — enemy objects lack .dist property (only set locally in render)","Bug 2: W/H undefined in loop() death screen — scope issue, only defined inside render()","Bug 3: damageFlash=1 not clamped to [0,1] range for alpha compositing","Fix all bugs and write corrected doom.html","Serve the fixed game on a preview port (9101-9150)","Test with Playwright — verify canvas renders, no JS errors in console"]},"status":"ok","ms":1}
